  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "The thrill of fighting dangerous monsters, the exhilaration of clearing the highest difficulty dungeons!! \n\nMy former self was intoxicated by his own power… but not anymore.\n\nRyouma was supposed to have died in battle, yet somehow he’s returned to the past. He has all the know-how and experience from his previous life. But if he can start over, peace is what matters most!\n\nHe chooses the non-combat class and deliberately picks the most generic player name possible: “Yamada Tarou” (essentially “John Smith”). \n\nHe plans to live a relaxed, laid-back life, but somehow, he keeps getting stronger anyway!?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/content/68935764) \n\n**Official Translations:**    \nJapanese (Localized): \n[Horizontal](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/313396/), [Vertical](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/313397/)",
